{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 96001, "name": "Meky Aljan", "username": "Meky", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/afea85/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-11-10T22:48:49.286Z", "cooked": "<p>Hi friends,</p>\n<p>Each time I use <code>autoremove</code> I lose the Night Light feature it’s setting working but no colors change, <code>dnf installed \"Fedora Workstation\"</code>  repair it but the  <code>autoremove</code> stopped it again, any solution please?</p>\n<p>Best regards</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/b/0/b0be975cd280890413e69247411aa79c58e8893f.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/pdynejfHjBsJ7UhMU7TFwkL4wwL.png?dl=1\" title=\"4befa5ddc86248e2391694e4de3ba5406942440c.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/b/0/b0be975cd280890413e69247411aa79c58e8893f_2_679x500.png\" alt=\"4befa5ddc86248e2391694e4de3ba5406942440c.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"pdynejfHjBsJ7UhMU7TFwkL4wwL\" width=\"679\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/b/0/b0be975cd280890413e69247411aa79c58e8893f_2_679x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/b/0/b0be975cd280890413e69247411aa79c58e8893f.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/b/0/b0be975cd280890413e69247411aa79c58e8893f.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"303134\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">4befa5ddc86248e2391694e4de3ba5406942440c.png</span><span class=\"informations\">1008×742 95.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 4, "updated_at": "2023-06-22T16:59:26.956Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 109, "reads": 21, "readers_count": 20, "score": 549.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 75804, "topic_slug": "night-light-stop-working-after-autoremove-any-solution-please", "display_username": "Meky Aljan", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 3, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/b/0/b0be975cd280890413e69247411aa79c58e8893f.png", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "b0be975cd280890413e69247411aa79c58e8893f.png", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 11682, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/night-light-stop-working-after-autoremove-any-solution-please/75804/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 148895, "name": "Jeff V", "username": "computersavvy", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/computersavvy/{size}/4741_2.png", "created_at": "2020-11-11T01:17:07.358Z", "cooked": "<p>You need to be aware of what autoremove does.  It removes (possibly) unused packages that have no dependency requirements and are leaves to the package manager tree, but those packages may be needed, so just using autoremove without verifying what is being removed can break things.</p>\n<p>If you look at what packages autoremove took away for you then you can reinstall the needed one for the night light feature.  dnf  history can help.</p>\n<p>I could be a bit sarcastic and say “if autoremove breaks your system then don’t use autoremove!”, but I won’t. <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 4, "updated_at": "2020-11-11T01:20:10.108Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 1, "reads": 21, "readers_count": 20, "score": 59.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 75804, "topic_slug": "night-light-stop-working-after-autoremove-any-solution-please", "display_username": "Jeff V", "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 53, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Q&A Leader", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 3}], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 3019, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/night-light-stop-working-after-autoremove-any-solution-please/75804/2", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 3}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 3, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 98518, "name": "Meky Aljan", "username": "Meky", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/afea85/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-11-11T05:23:47.161Z", "cooked": "<p>Thanks <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/computersavvy\">@computersavvy</a> you are right, I always read carefully and try to understand which packages the <code>autoremove</code> will remove but I am still not a pro user.</p>\n<p>I fixed the problem, I use NVIDIA driver and the NVIDIA uses xorg server and it set it as default for Gnome, after I did an <code>autoremove</code> the default server was changed to Wayland so I did:</p>\n<p>1- A <code>reinstall</code> to <code>akmod-nvidia</code> (not sure if it’s necessary).<br>\n2- A <code>reinstall</code> to <code>xorg-x11-drv-nvidia-cuda</code> (also not sure if it’s necessary).<br>\n3- Edit /etc/gdm/custom.conf  by uncommenting  “<strong>WaylandEnable=false</strong>” and adding “<strong>DefaultSession=gnome-xorg.desktop</strong>”.</p>\n<p>now I can do an <code>autoremove</code> without losing the Night Light feature.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/2/3/230aebf2956c2940223b6e1dbec2403b296ac336.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/5006SP4SbuxJRgVS8pnDN0KClqC.png?dl=1\" title=\"0be947d7ce9683a277f2c20cc4ac987599780809.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/2/3/230aebf2956c2940223b6e1dbec2403b296ac336.png\" alt=\"0be947d7ce9683a277f2c20cc4ac987599780809.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"5006SP4SbuxJRgVS8pnDN0KClqC\" width=\"662\" height=\"500\" data-dominant-color=\"343636\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">0be947d7ce9683a277f2c20cc4ac987599780809.png</span><span class=\"informations\">706×533 32.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Best Regards.</p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 4, "updated_at": "2023-03-09T06:25:56.027Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 14, "reads": 20, "readers_count": 19, "score": 79.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 75804, "topic_slug": "night-light-stop-working-after-autoremove-any-solution-please", "display_username": "Meky Aljan", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/2/3/230aebf2956c2940223b6e1dbec2403b296ac336.png", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "230aebf2956c2940223b6e1dbec2403b296ac336.png", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 1865, "username": "waterbox", "name": "waterbox", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/w/db3279/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 11682, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [{"id": 3019, "username": "computersavvy", "name": "Jeff V", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/computersavvy/{size}/4741_2.png"}], "post_url": "/t/night-light-stop-working-after-autoremove-any-solution-please/75804/3", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": true, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 131957, "name": "Jeff V", "username": "computersavvy", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/computersavvy/{size}/4741_2.png", "cr